  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Touch a life with the gift of education in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2012, the NAPE Foundation has awarded over 500 scholarships to Ghanaian students to pursue higher education. Palm Institute, a private liberal arts University College in Ghana has been educating the youth for 10years. The mission of the University College is to produce not just regular graduates, but educated ethical and excellent leaders who have the burden to change the story of the African continent in the area of leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
